## Section 2 — Skip Link (first child of `<body>`)

```html
<a href="#main-content" class="skip-link">Skip to main content</a>
```

CSS (include in every page's `<style>`):
```css
.skip-link {
    position: absolute; top: -40px; left: 0;
    background: var(--brand-deep-blue); color: var(--brand-white);
    padding: 8px 16px; text-decoration: none;
    z-index: 10000; border-radius: 0 0 8px 0; font-weight: 600;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
}
.skip-link:focus { top: 0; outline: 3px solid var(--brand-yellow); }
```

